message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PD-Design-Kit: Ge-on-Si Photodiode Design Toolkit for PAM-4 Optical Receivers"
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-04-19"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.19652934
url: "https://github.com/iabdul-aal/PD-design-kit"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Abdulaal
    given-names: Islam I.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-9300-3936"
    affiliation: "Electronics and Communications Engineering, Faculty of Engineering, Alexandria University"
abstract: >
  A comprehensive design and simulation toolkit for Ge-on-Si O-band photodiodes,
  spanning system-level MATLAB modeling to device-level Lumerical FDTD and CHARGE
  simulations. Includes a Lumerical INTERCONNECT-ready compact photodetector data
  export for circuit-level insertion. Targets high-speed PAM-4 optical receivers at
  1310 nm with >100 GHz bandwidth.
keywords:
  - photodiode
